<!-- PROCESS -->
<section class="block" id="process" aria-labelledby="process-title">
  <div class="head">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow rv">How I work</span>
      <h2 id="process-title" class="rv d1">
        From idea to launch
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p class="rv d2">Clear steps, so you always know what happens next.</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="process" data-process>
    <li class="fill" aria-hidden="true"></li>
    <li class="step rv">
      <span class="n">01</span>
      <h3>Discover</h3>
      <p>We agree on the problem, the users and what must never go wrong.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step rv d1">
      <span class="n">02</span>
      <h3>Design</h3>
      <p>Screens, data model and a plan split into small milestones.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step rv d2">
      <span class="n">03</span>
      <h3>Build &amp; test</h3>
      <p>Working software every milestone, with automated tests from day one.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step rv d3">
      <span class="n">04</span>
      <h3>Launch &amp; support</h3>
      <p>Deploy, monitor and hand over clear docs you can keep.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
